{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n1-242":{"renderings":[{"id":"8965d091e518893c","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-242"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Also expresses an extreme degree or state, typically negative."},{"id":"4c16befee70375e3","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-242"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The ～極まる form often appears with な-adjectives: e.g., 失礼極まる, 非常識極まる ('extremely rude/unreasonable'). It's largely synonymous with ～極まりない but tends to appear in set phrases. Both forms are quite formal and emphatic."},{"id":"ee1a0f0cfe94ba61","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-242"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"な-Adjective（語幹）+ 極まる, い-Adjective（連用形）+ こと + 極まる, etc."},{"id":"fa34dd819863f51b","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n1-242"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"極まる: extremely, usually negative (失礼極まる)."},{"id":"56792fe4e4b22dce","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"extremity"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Extremity (Extremely / Utterly)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"extremity"}}]},"n1-242#8c35cf74f1bc":{"renderings":[{"id":"cce2a56f630dc99c","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-242"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"His words and actions are extremely rude."}]},"n1-242#e424225549ac":{"renderings":[{"id":"245d4d8335af8d90","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-242"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"That behavior is utterly irrational."}]},"n1-242#502edae7b95f":{"renderings":[{"id":"39e899db919413de","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-242"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Her remark is extremely irresponsible."}]},"n1-242#1eca3f2657e2":{"renderings":[{"id":"0e7864d16d2529df","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-242"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Such a misunderstanding is exceedingly regrettable."}]}}}